+
+### Winding Journey Path
+```xml
+<path class="journey-path" d="
+  M 80 100 
+  L 200 100 
+  Q 280 100 280 150 
+  L 280 180
+  Q 280 220 320 220
+  L 520 220
+  Q 560 220 560 260
+  L 560 320
+  Q 560 360 520 360
+  L 280 360
+  ...
+"/>
+```
