+<circle class="transformer-coil" cx="55" cy="25" r="12"/>
+<rect class="transformer-core" x="35" y="15" width="10" height="20" rx="2"/>
+<!-- Busbars -->
+<line x1="0" y1="15" x2="-10" y2="15" stroke="#EF9F27" stroke-width="3"/>
+```
+
+### Pole-mounted Transformer
