+
+## Layout Notes
+
+- **ViewBox**: 820×520 (wide for 4-column layout)
+- **Column widths**: ~200px per stage
+- **Stage dividers**: Vertical dashed lines at x=200, 420, 620
+- **Stage labels**: Top of diagram, uppercase for emphasis
